    {
      "id": "claim_d044366920564d519a66f6d2cac9a63e",
      "statement": "JobQueue.TryAdd returns false in exactly two situations - the key is already in flight, or the channel writer is completed by shutdown - never for capacity, because the channel is unbounded. The duplicate case is normal traffic: the processor logs only a Debug line and neither throws nor comments on the issue.",
