    {
      "id": "claim_5ea6708608f24b3587317188eecbfa93",
      "statement": "A duplicate delivery is dropped rather than queued, and ImplementSpec captures the issue title and body as primary-constructor values at enqueue time, so an issue edit delivered while the job runs is discarded and the agent works from the pre-edit spec; picking up the edit requires another qualifying delivery after the current run finishes and releases the key.",
